[00:12.24]1. Sing to God a song, A song of praise that’s bold and new.
[00:21.92]Tell of all the great things He’s done and yet will do.
[00:29.90]Praise his mighty arm; He is the God of victory.
[00:38.18]In the cause of justice,
[00:41.62]He judges righteously.
[00:46.38](Chorus)
[00:46.38]Sing, sing, sing!
[00:49.58]The new song, let it ring!
[00:53.84]Sing, sing, sing!
[00:57.62]Jehovah is our King.
[01:03.06]2. Make a joyful shout, A joyful cry to God, our King!
[01:09.68]Laud his name, give honor; A joyful anthem sing.
[01:10.08]Join the mighty crowd, And sing aloud before the Lord.
[01:10.08]Harp and horn and trumpet
[01:39.88]Sound praise in full accord.
[01:44.48](Chorus)
[01:45.46]Sing, sing, sing!
[01:48.54]The new song, let it ring!
[01:52.78]Sing, sing, sing!
[01:56.46]Jehovah is our King.
[02:12.00]3. Let the mighty sea And all that fills it give him praise.
[02:19.86]Join with earth’s creation, And joyful voices raise.
[02:28.40]Let the land rejoice, And let the rivers clap their hands.
[02:35.30]Mountains, hills, and valleys
[02:38.92]Sing praise in all the lands.
[02:44.38](Chorus)
[02:44.38]Sing, sing, sing!
[02:47.52]The new song, let it ring!
[02:51.78]Sing, sing, sing!
[02:55.56]Jehovah is our King.
